{"fixes":[{"id":7,"status":"resolved","note":"Momentum is credited exactly once by the terminal recursive invocation and only for a succeeded RunOutcome; superseded nudge/verification invocations return without credit. No new race is introduced."},{"id":8,"status":"not-resolved","note":"Nudge and verification recursion now preserve each runAgentLoop invocation exactly once, but the direct forced-synthesis model invocation is still folded into thisAttempt rather than represented as its own ModelAttemptOutcome, so attempts does not carry every model invocation."},{"id":9,"status":"not-resolved","note":"Fallback/nudge/verification actions are appended in order, and fallback-then-terminal-synthesis is correct. However forced_synthesis is appended only at the terminal; if synthesis succeeds and that turn then enters verification_retry, the recursive terminal emits only verification_retry, losing the earlier forced_synthesis action."}],"new_P0_P1":[]}
